+*   `PiecewiseFunction`: Maps scalar values to opacity [S2, unofficial].
+*   `ContourValues`: A container storing the specific scalar values defining the isosurfaces [S1, S2, unofficial].
 
 **Parameters:**
-*   **Blend Mode:** `ISOSURFACE_BLEND` (or `IsoSurface` in VTK API) [S1, S2, unofficial].
